{"id": "e959cfa9-cd0a-44af-b87a-87e4d86c6a90", "slug": "aether-digital-artifacts", "title": "AETHER | Digital Artifacts", "description": "Aether Digital Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"AETHER | Digital Artifacts\"\ndescription: \"Aether Digital Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#050505\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#050505\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#A3A3A3\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#A3A3A3\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"23px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# AETHER | Digital Artifacts\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 2; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: login, animated, input, validation, security.\n## Overview\nAether Digital Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nAETHER Architecture Protocols Manifesto Access Portal System Online Tangible depth. Digital absolute. Experience cryptographic constructs rendered with sub-pixel perfection. A new paradigm for ownership, materialized th…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Tangible depth. Digital absolute.; CHRONOS CORE.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #050505, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #050505, background #050505, surface #A3A3A3, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>AETHER | Digital Artifacts</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-neutral-300 h-screen w-screen overflow-hidden flex flex-col selection:bg-neutral-800 selection:text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n  \n  <!-- Ambient Background Gradients -->\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none overflow-hidden z-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"w-[70vw] h-[70vw] bg-neutral-900/40 rounded-full blur-[120px] absolute opacity-50 mix-blend-screen scale-150 transform-gpu translate-y-1/4\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation -->\n  <nav class=\"w-full flex justify-between items-center px-6 md:px-12 py-8 z-20 relative opacity-0\" id=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"text-lg tracking-[0.25em] font-medium uppercase text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:planet-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-xl\"></iconify-icon>\n      AETHER\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hidden md:flex gap-10 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-neutral-500\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Architecture</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Protocols</a>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">Manifesto</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-full overflow-hidden inline-flex cursor-pointer group\">\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-400/30 via-neutral-400/10 to-neutral-400/30 rounded-full group-hover:from-white/50 group-hover:to-white/50 transition-colors duration-700\"></div>\n      <div class=\"relative bg-[#050505] text-xs font-medium px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-neutral-300 group-hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        Access Portal\n        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </nav>\n\n  <!-- Main Content -->\n  <main class=\"flex-1 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center md:justify-between px-6 md:px-12 relative z-10 gap-12 md:gap-0 h-full pb-10 md:pb-0\">\n    \n    <!-- Left Column: Copy -->\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-8 z-20 md:pr-12\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 opacity-0\" id=\"badge\">\n        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-neutral-400\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(163, 163, 163, 0.5);\"></span>\n        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-neutral-400\">System Online</span>\n      </div>\n      \n      <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl tracking-tight font-semibold leading-[1.1] text-white reveal-text\">\n        Tangible depth. <br />\n        Digital absolute.\n      </h1>\n      \n      <p class=\"text-sm md:text-base text-neutral-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed reveal-text font-light\">\n        Experience cryptographic constructs rendered with sub-pixel perfection. A new paradigm for ownership, materialized through ambient computation.\n      </p>\n      \n      <div class=\"pt-4 opacity-0\" id=\"cta\">\n        <button class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white group\">\n          <span class=\"border-b border-white/20 pb-1 group-hover:border-white/60 transition-colors duration-300\">Explore Archives</span>\n          <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-neutral-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Right Column: 3D Holographic Card -->\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 flex justify-center items-center h-full max-h-[60vh] md:max-h-none\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n      <div id=\"tilt\" class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] md:max-w-[340px] aspect-[1/1.4] relative transform-gpu\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d; will-change: transform;\">\n        \n        <!-- Gradient Border Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 p-[1px] rounded-[24px] bg-gradient-to-br from-neutral-400/40 via-neutral-800/10 to-neutral-500/20 shadow-[0_30px_80px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] opacity-0 transform-gpu translate-y-12 scale-95\" id=\"card-wrapper\">\n          \n          <div id=\"card\" class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-[23px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0a0a] transform-gpu\">\n            <!-- WebGL Canvas -->\n            <canvas id=\"gl\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full block z-0\"></canvas>\n            \n            <!-- Vignette Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-10 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/10 to-black/30 pointer-events-none mix-blend-multiply\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Card UI Content -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none text-white\">\n              \n              <!-- Header -->\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-neutral-400 card-elem\">\n                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><iconify-icon icon=\"solar:shield-keyhole-linear\"></iconify-icon> SECURE</span>\n                <span>GENESIS / 01</span>\n              </div>\n              \n              <!-- Mid Data -->\n              <div class=\"w-full card-elem\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-2\">\n                  <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-none text-white drop-shadow-lg\">\n                    CHRONOS <br/> CORE\n                  </h2>\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-neutral-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"h-[1px] w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-400/50 to-transparent my-3\"></div>\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-neutral-400\">Class: Singularity / Tier X</p>\n              </div>\n              \n              <!-- Footer Stats -->\n              <div class=\"flex gap-4 card-elem\">\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                  <span class=\"block text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-white drop-shadow-md\">99.8</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-0.5 block\">Resonance</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                  <span class=\"block text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-white drop-shadow-md\">42k</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-0.5 block\">Cycles</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1\">\n                  <span class=\"block text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold text-white drop-shadow-md\">0.01</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[9px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500 uppercase mt-0.5 block\">Latency</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    // 1. Text Splitting for Masked Reveal\n    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-text').forEach(el => {\n      const text = el.innerHTML;\n      // Handle <br> tags properly by splitting on them first\n      const lines = text.split(/<br\\s*\\/?>/i);\n      el.innerHTML = '';\n      \n      lines.forEach((line, lineIndex) => {\n        const words = line.trim().split(' ');\n        words.forEach(word => {\n          if(!word) return;\n          const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n          wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n          wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'top';\n          wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.3em';\n\n          const inner = document.createElement('span');\n          inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n          inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%) rotate(2deg)';\n          inner.style.transformOrigin = 'top left';\n          inner.classList.add('word-inner');\n          inner.innerHTML = word;\n\n          wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n          el.appendChild(wrapper);\n        });\n        if (lineIndex < lines.length - 1) {\n          el.appendChild(document.createElement('br'));\n        }\n      });\n    });\n\n    // 2. GSAP Initialization Animations\n    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n      const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power4.out' } });\n\n      tl.to('#nav', { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1.5, ease: 'power3.out' }, 0.2)\n        .to('#badge', { opacity: 1, duration: 1 }, 0.4)\n        .to('.word-inner', {\n          y: '0%',\n          rotation: 0,\n          duration: 1.2,\n          stagger: 0.04,\n        }, 0.5)\n        .to('#cta', { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1 }, 1.2)\n        .to('#card-wrapper', {\n          opacity: 1,\n          y: 0,\n          scale: 1,\n          duration: 1.8,\n          ease: 'expo.out'\n        }, 0.8)\n        .fromTo('.card-elem', \n          { opacity: 0, y: 15 },\n          { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 1, stagger: 0.15 }, \n          1.4\n        );\n    });\n\n    // 3. WebGL Holographic Shader Logic\n    (function(){\n      var cv = document.getElementById('gl');\n      var gl = cv.getContext('webgl');\n      if(!gl) return;\n\n      var VS = 'attribute vec2 p;void main(){gl_Position=vec4(p,0.,1.);}';\n      \n      // Neutral, cinematic silver/monochrome/amber-tint shader\n      var FS = [\n        'precision highp float;',\n        'uniform vec2 u_res;',\n        'uniform float u_time;',\n        'uniform vec2 u_ptr;',\n        'uniform float u_hov;',\n        'float hash(vec2 p){p=fract(p*vec2(127.1,311.7));p+=dot(p,p+19.19);return fract(p.x*p.y);}',\n        'float vnoise(vec2 p){vec2 i=floor(p),f=fract(p);vec2 u=f*f*(3.0-2.0*f);',\n        ' return mix(mix(hash(i),hash(i+vec2(1.,0.)),u.x),mix(hash(i+vec2(0.,1.)),hash(i+vec2(1.,1.)),u.x),u.y);}',\n        'float fbm(vec2 p){float v=0.0,a=0.5;for(int i=0;i<4;i++){v+=a*vnoise(p);p=p*2.03+vec2(1.7,9.2);a*=0.5;}return v;}',\n        \n        // Custom palette generating neutral metallic tones with a slight warm hint\n        'vec3 pal(float t){',\n        '  float c = cos(6.28318*(t)); float s = sin(6.28318*(t));',\n        '  return vec3(0.5) + 0.5 * vec3(c, c*0.95+s*0.05, c*0.9+s*0.1);',\n        '}',\n        \n        'void main(){',\n        ' vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy/u_res;',\n        ' vec2 p = uv-0.5; p.x *= u_res.x/u_res.y;',\n        \n        // Dark metallic base\n        ' vec3 base = mix(vec3(0.03,0.03,0.035), vec3(0.08,0.08,0.09), uv.y);',\n        \n        ' float warp = fbm(uv*3.0 + u_time*0.04);',\n        ' float ang = uv.x*1.5 - uv.y*1.2 + (u_ptr.x-0.5)*2.0 + (u_ptr.y-0.5)*1.5 + warp*1.2 + u_time*0.03;',\n        \n        ' vec3 irid = pal(ang*1.2 + warp*0.4);',\n        // Desaturate slightly for the 'Linear' neutral aesthetic\n        ' float lum = dot(irid, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114));',\n        ' irid = mix(vec3(lum), irid, 0.4);',\n        \n        ' float bands = pow(0.5 + 0.5*sin(ang*12.0 + warp*5.0), 2.0);',\n        \n        ' vec2 dir = normalize(vec2(0.7,0.7));',\n        ' float sweep = exp(-8.0 * abs(dot(p,dir) - (u_ptr.x-0.5)*1.5 - (u_ptr.y-0.5)*0.8));',\n        \n        // Micro-texture / Sparkles\n        ' vec2 g = uv*vec2(150.0, 200.0);',\n        ' vec2 id = floor(g);',\n        ' float h = hash(id);',\n        ' float tw = pow(0.5 + 0.5*sin(u_time*2.0 + h*50.0 + (u_ptr.x+u_ptr.y)*6.0), 20.0);',\n        ' vec2 jit = (vec2(hash(id+7.3), hash(id+3.7))-0.5)*0.6;',\n        ' float spark = step(0.9, h) * tw * (1.0-smoothstep(0.0, 0.5, length(fract(g)-0.5-jit)));',\n        \n        ' float foil = (bands*0.4 + sweep*0.8) * (0.5 + 0.5*u_hov);',\n        \n        // Composite\n        ' vec3 col = base + irid*foil*0.9 + vec3(0.9, 0.95, 1.0)*spark*(0.4+0.6*u_hov);',\n        \n        // Subtle edge vignette\n        ' float vg = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.2, 1.3, length(p*vec2(0.8, 1.0)));',\n        ' col *= mix(0.6, 1.0, vg);',\n        \n        ' gl_FragColor = vec4(col, 1.0);',\n        '}'\n      ].join('\\n');\n\n      function sh(type,src){\n        var s=gl.createShader(type);\n        gl.shaderSource(s,src);gl.compileShader(s);\n        return s;\n      }\n      var pr=gl.createProgram();\n      gl.attachShader(pr,sh(gl.VERTEX_SHADER,VS));\n      gl.attachShader(pr,sh(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER,FS));\n      gl.linkProgram(pr);\n      gl.useProgram(pr);\n\n      var buf=gl.createBuffer();\n      gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,buf);\n      gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER,new Float32Array([-1,-1,3,-1,-1,3]),gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n      var loc=gl.getAttribLocation(pr,'p');\n      gl.enableVertexAttribArray(loc);\n      gl.vertexAttribPointer(loc,2,gl.FLOAT,false,0,0);\n\n      var uRes=gl.getUniformLocation(pr,'u_res');\n      var uTime=gl.getUniformLocation(pr,'u_time');\n      var uPtr=gl.getUniformLocation(pr,'u_ptr');\n      var uHov=gl.getUniformLocation(pr,'u_hov');\n\n      function fit(){\n        var d=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,2);\n        cv.width=Math.round(cv.clientWidth*d);\n        cv.height=Math.round(cv.clientHeight*d);\n        gl.viewport(0,0,cv.width,cv.height);\n      }\n      fit();\n      window.addEventListener('resize',fit);\n\n      // Mouse tracking on the whole window for ambient effect\n      var px=0.5, py=0.5, tx=0.5, ty=0.5;\n      var hov=0, th=0;\n      var rx=0, ry=0, tRx=0, tRy=0;\n      var tilt = document.getElementById('tilt');\n\n      window.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n        var nx = e.clientX / window.innerWidth;\n        var ny = e.clientY / window.innerHeight;\n        tx = nx;\n        ty = ny;\n        // Subtle 3D rotation based on full screen mouse position\n        tRx = (0.5 - ty) * 20; \n        tRy = (tx - 0.5) * 20;\n        th = 1;\n      });\n      \n      window.addEventListener('pointerleave', function(){\n        tx=0.5; ty=0.5; tRx=0; tRy=0; th=0;\n      });\n\n      var t0=null;\n      function frame(now){\n        if(t0===null) t0=now;\n        var t = (now-t0)/1000;\n        \n        // Smooth interpolation\n        px += (tx-px)*0.06; \n        py += (ty-py)*0.06;\n        hov += (th-hov)*0.05;\n        rx += (tRx-rx)*0.08; \n        ry += (tRy-ry)*0.08;\n        \n        tilt.style.transform = 'rotateX('+rx.toFixed(3)+'deg) rotateY('+ry.toFixed(3)+'deg)';\n        \n        gl.uniform2f(uRes, cv.width, cv.height);\n        gl.uniform1f(uTime, t);\n        gl.uniform2f(uPtr, px, 1.0-py);\n        gl.uniform1f(uHov, hov);\n        gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLES, 0, 3);\n        \n        requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n      }\n      requestAnimationFrame(frame);\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aether-digital-artifacts.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aether-digital-artifacts.jpg", "source_name": "aether-digital-artifacts-DESIGN.md", "views": 35, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-27T15:46:32.161441+00:00"}